---
import { productExperience } from '../data/portfolio';
import CareerArc from './CareerArc.astro';
---

<section class="experience-section container" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
  <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
    <div>
      <p class="section-heading__eyebrow">Experience</p>
      <h2 id="experience-title">한눈에 보는 경력</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      성과와 구현 설명은 대표 프로젝트로 넘기고, 여기서는 2022년 이후 맡은 역할이 어떻게
      달라졌는지만 최근 순으로 정리했습니다.
    </p>
  </div>

  <CareerArc />

  <ol class="experience-list" aria-label="역할별 경력">
    {
      productExperience.map((item) => (
        <li class="experience-item">
          <p class="experience-item__period">{item.period}</p>
          <div class="experience-item__body">
            <span class="experience-item__label">{item.label}</span>
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p>{item.summary}</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="experience-item__scope">
            <dt>맡은 범위</dt>
            <dd>{item.scope}</dd>
          </dl>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>
</section>
